PushListModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Appends a byte list to the WASM output stream (state["out"]). Group analog of Push.
    Provides: PushList(state, lst) -> state. Concatenates lst (Int list) onto state["out"], returns the updated state.
    DependsOn: none (leaf; Core.MapGet/ListConcat/MapSet).
    Composition: Native include from modules/GenWasm/GenWasm.sir (Path: ../PushList/PushList.sir).
    Notes: used to append already-formed sequences (e.g. an EmitU32LEB/EmitSignedLEB result) so the caller controls byte order.
